            <div class="featured-link"><h4 class="featured-link-title white">News &amp; Events</h4><p class="featured-link-description white large">Discover highlights from across the Foundation’s focus areas, key announcements and our events.</p><a class="featured-link-arrow white" href="/news-events/" ><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/arrow-right-white.svg" alt=""></a></div><div class="sub-menu" role="menu" aria-labelledby="menu-item-149"><div class="sub-menu-column"><ul><li><a class="graphite " href="/news-events/foundation-news/">Foundation News</a></li><li><a class="graphite " href="/news-events/events/">Events</a></li><li><a class="graphite " href="/newsletter/">Newsletter sign up</a></li></ul></div><div class="sub-menu-column"><ul><li><a class="graphite " href="#">Featured</a></li><li><a href="/news-events/trust-conference/" class="nav-featured-block" style="background-color: #173e91"><span>4-5 November</span><p>Trust Conference</p><p>2026</p><div class="featured-link-arrow white"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/arrow-right-white.svg" alt=""></div></a></li></ul></div></div>
